{"sha": "3e29f32138f04f8b8105ec045aed7b860b39e975b744cff62a58c5523d186abd", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:linalg:12}", "\\emph{$D$ 可逆。}右乘分块矩阵", "$T = \\begin{psmallmatrix} I & 0\\\\ -D^{-1}C & I\\end{psmallmatrix}$,", "该矩阵为对角块为单位阵的分块三角阵，故 $\\det T = 1$（其", "行列式由置换公式可知，只取对角线上的", "块 --- 即\\cref{exo:b2:linalg:2}中的分块规则）：", "\\[", "\\begin{pmatrix} A & B\\\\ C & D\\end{pmatrix} T", "= \\begin{pmatrix} A - BD^{-1}C & B\\\\ C - DD^{-1}C & D\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} A - BD^{-1}C & B\\\\ 0 & D\\end{pmatrix},", "\\]", "其行列式为 $\\det(A - BD^{-1}C)\\det D = \\det\\bigl((A -", "BD^{-1}C)D\\bigr) = \\det(AD - BD^{-1}CD)$。由于 $CD = DC$，", "$BD^{-1}CD = BC$：行列式为 $\\det(AD - BC)$。", "", "\\emph{一般情形 $D$。}令 $D_t = D + tI$，则仍有 $CD_t = D_tC$。", "二者", "\\[", "f(t) = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} A & B\\\\ C & D_t\\end{pmatrix}", "\\qquad\\text{与}\\qquad", "g(t) = \\det(AD_t - BC)", "\\]", "均为 $t$ 的多项式函数。多项式 $\\det(D + tI)$ 是", "首一的，次数为 $n$，故至多有 $n$ 个根：除有限多个", "$t$ 之外，$D_t$ 可逆，且 $f(t) = g(t)$", "由前一情形可得。无限域上的两个多项式在", "无穷多点处取值相同，则二者相等：$f = g$，令 $t = 0$ 即得结论。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:linalg:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\Phi$ 是线性映射，且 $\\ker\\Phi = \\bigcap_i", "\\ker\\varphi_i$（$p$ 元组为零，当且仅当每个分量为零）。对", "坐标线性型 $\\varepsilon_i$（$K^p$ 上的）：$\\Phi^{\\mathsf", "T}(\\varepsilon_i) = \\varepsilon_i \\circ \\Phi = \\varphi_i$，于是", "$\\operatorname{im}\\Phi^{\\mathsf T} \\supseteq", "\\operatorname{Vect}(\\varphi_i)$；反之", "$\\operatorname{im}\\Phi^{\\mathsf T}$ 由", "$\\Phi^{\\mathsf T}(\\varepsilon_i)$ 张成（$\\varepsilon_i$ 张成", "$(K^p)^*$）。故 $\\operatorname{rk}\\Phi = \\operatorname{rk}", "\\Phi^{\\mathsf T} = \\dim\\operatorname{Vect}(\\varphi_1, \\dots,", "\\varphi_p) =: r$（见\\cref{prop:b2:linalg:transposerank}），", "由秩--零化度定理可得 $\\dim\\bigcap_i\\ker\\varphi_i = n - r$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} （$\\Leftarrow$）取一极大线性无关子族，不妨记为", "$\\varphi_1, \\dots, \\varphi_r$，它们张成同一空间（故", "假设仍为 $\\bigcap_{i \\leq r}\\ker\\varphi_i \\subseteq", "\\ker\\varphi$：对全体 $i$ 的交与", "$i \\leq r$ 的交相等，因被舍去的每个线性型都是余下者的线性组合）。映射", "$\\Psi = (\\varphi_1, \\dots, \\varphi_r) \\colon E \\to K^r$ 为", "满射（由第 1 问，其秩为 $r$）。若 $\\Psi(x) = \\Psi(y)$", "则 $x - y \\in \\ker\\Psi \\subseteq \\ker\\varphi$，故 $\\varphi(x) =", "\\varphi(y)$：$\\varphi$ 可分解为 $\\varphi = \\lambda \\circ \\Psi$", "其中 $\\lambda \\colon K^r \\to K$ 良定义；$\\lambda$ 是线性的，", "因 $\\Psi$ 线性且满射（对 $t = \\Psi(x)$，$t' =", "\\Psi(x')$: $\\lambda(t + \\alpha t') = \\varphi(x + \\alpha x') =", "\\lambda(t) + \\alpha\\lambda(t')$）。记 $\\lambda = \\sum c_i", "\\varepsilon_i$: $\\varphi = \\sum_{i \\leq r} c_i\\varphi_i$.", "（$\\Rightarrow$）若 $\\varphi = \\sum c_i \\varphi_i$，则任一 $x$", "使每个 $\\varphi_i$ 为零，亦必使 $\\varphi$ 为零。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 由第 1 问，$\\dim\\bigcap\\ker\\varphi_i = n - r$", "其中 $r = \\dim\\operatorname{Vect}(\\varphi_i) \\leq p$，且 $r = p$", "当且仅当该族线性无关。设 $F$ 为余维数为 $p$ 的子空间，其", "零化子的维数为 $p$", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:linalg:annihilator}）；若 $(\\varphi_1, \\dots,", "\\varphi_p)$ 为 $F^\\circ$ 的一组基，则 $F = \\bigcap_i\\ker\\varphi_i$（", "即恢复公式）。若线性型更少，则 $q$ 个超平面的交", "维数 $\\geq n - q > n - p$（由第 1 问）。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 计算 $\\ker\\varphi_1 \\cap \\ker\\varphi_2$：由 $x", "+ y - z = 0$ 与 $y + z - t = 0$，以 $(y, z)$ 参数化：$x = z", "- y$，$t = y + z$，得向量构成的平面 $(z - y,\\; y,\\;", "z,\\; y + z)$。其上，$\\psi = x + 2y - t = (z - y) + 2y - (y + z)", "= 0$：由分解引理得 $\\psi \\in", "\\operatorname{Vect}(\\varphi_1, \\varphi_2)$ --- 事实上 $\\psi =", "\\varphi_1 + \\varphi_2$。但 $\\psi' = x + y + t = (z - y) + y +", "(y + z) = y + 2z$ 在其上并非恒为零（$y = 1, z = 0$", "给出 $1$）：$\\psi' \\notin \\operatorname{Vect}(\\varphi_1,", "\\varphi_2)$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $3$ 维空间上的三个线性型：只需", "验证线性无关即可。若 $a\\psi_0 + b\\psi_1 + c\\psi_2 = 0$，代入 $1, X,", "X^2$: $a + b + c = 0$, $b + \\frac c2 = 0$, $b + \\frac c3 = 0$;", "后两式相减得 $c = 0$，进而 $b = 0$，$a = 0$。", "前对偶基：记 $P = \\alpha + \\beta X + \\gamma X^2$，并解", "方程 $\\psi_i(P_j) = \\delta_{ij}$（$P(0) = \\alpha$，$P(1) =", "\\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma$, $\\int_0^1 P = \\alpha + \\frac\\beta2 +", "\\frac\\gamma3$):", "\\[", "P_0 = 1 - 4X + 3X^2, \\qquad", "P_1 = -2X + 3X^2, \\qquad", "P_2 = 6X - 6X^2 .", "\\]", "（验证，例如：$\\int_0^1 P_2 = 3 - 2 = 1$，$P_2(0) = P_2(1) = 0$。）", "插值问题可由", "前对偶基下的坐标求解：", "\\[", "P = 1\\cdot P_0 + 2\\cdot P_1 + \\tfrac32\\, P_2 = 1 + X", "\\]", "（$X$ 的系数 $-4 - 4 + 9 = 1$，$X^2$ 的系数 $3 + 6 - 9 =", "0$）；事实上 $P(0) = 1$，$P(1) = 2$，$\\int_0^1 P = \\frac32$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 线性性：对每个 $\\varphi$，$J(x + \\alpha", "y)(\\varphi) = \\varphi(x + \\alpha y) = J(x)(\\varphi) + \\alpha", "J(y)(\\varphi)$，即 $J(x + \\alpha y) = J(x) + \\alpha J(y)$。单射性：若 $x \\neq 0$，", "将 $x = e_1$ 扩充为一组基；坐标线性型 $e_1^*$ 有", "$J(x)(e_1^*) = 1 \\neq 0$。由于 $\\dim E^{**} = \\dim E^* = \\dim", "E$，故单射即双射。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 包含关系：对 $x \\in F$ 与 $\\varphi \\in F^\\circ$，", "$J(x)(\\varphi) = \\varphi(x) = 0$，故 $J(F) \\subseteq", "F^{\\circ\\circ}$。比较维数", "（两次应用\\cref{thm:b2:linalg:annihilator}）：", "\\[", "\\dim F^{\\circ\\circ} = \\dim E^* - \\dim F^\\circ", "= n - (n - \\dim F) = \\dim F = \\dim J(F),", "\\]", "因 $J$ 为单射，故 $J(F) = F^{\\circ\\circ}$。", ""]}